    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ A_{i} $ is the mean genotypic value associated with the ith family, $ a_{ij} $ is the deviation from that value for the jth member of the family, $ E_{i} $ is the maternal effect associated with the ith family, and $ e_{ij} $ is the residual environmental effect on the ijth individual.",
      "source_page": 276,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter10:p010:b6"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        132.0,
